    "independent_noble_table": {
      "title": "airicyu/fortel-ziweidoushu official source, MinorStar.MINOR_STAR_BENEFACTOR_WOMAN",
      "school": "中州派（repository README自述），不作古籍校勘依据",
      "commit": "2620cc895395f9f6994abd4927e739d31015c67d",
      "package_version": "1.3.4",
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airicyu/fortel-ziweidoushu/2620cc895395f9f6994abd4927e739d31015c67d/src/model/minorStar.ts",
      "supporting_urls": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airicyu/fortel-ziweidoushu/2620cc895395f9f6994abd4927e739d31015c67d/src/model/sky.ts",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airicyu/fortel-ziweidoushu/2620cc895395f9f6994abd4927e739d31015c67d/src/model/ground.ts",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airicyu/fortel-ziweidoushu/2620cc895395f9f6994abd4927e739d31015c67d/package.json"
      ],
      "derivation": "minorStar.ts lines 84–91 map year-sky indices through [7,8,9,9,7,8,7,2,5,5]. sky.ts defines 甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸 as indices 0..9, ground.ts defines 子丑寅卯辰巳午未申酉戌亥 as indices 0..11. Thus 丙(index2) and 丁(index3) each map to 9=酉. This is a direct source-table check; Fortel was neither installed nor executed.",
      "independence": "Official package dependencies list only util; this table does not call iztro. Only the named noble-star values were checked here, not a full second-engine chart."
    }
  },
  "method": [
    "All cases use a non-leap lunar month and times at least 30 minutes inside the named two-hour period, at UTC+08 and longitude 120 degrees. They do not establish leap-month, late-Zi, target-period or historical-timezone correctness.",
    "Life/body branches were counted from 寅 as first month, then backward/forward by the birth-hour branch. The palace stem was counted forward from the source’s five-tiger 寅 stem; its named 納音 determines the element class.",
    "紫微 was read directly from each fixed five-element/day diagram (not computed by the application). 天府 was reflected across 寅/申 using the classical diagram. Each remaining major star was counted from the two anchors using 安南北斗諸星訣 and frozen as an absolute branch.",
    "輔弼 follow month, 昌曲 and 空劫 follow hour, 魁鉞 and 祿羊陀 follow year stem; 天馬 follows the year-branch trine. The source’s 天空 in 天空地劫訣 corresponds to the modern 地空 name; it is distinct from the separately placed 天空 adjective star. The cited transcript literally reads 丙丁豬狗位 (天鉞戌), while the adopted table uses 酉; these two cases preserve 戌 in the classical expected data and separately identify Fortel-backed 酉.",
    "Brightness checks are restricted to 紫微、天機、武曲, directly transcribed from the twelve-branch table. This does not independently certify every star brightness.",
    "Year transformations use the classical table in 祿、權、科、忌 order. The 壬化科 discrepancy is explicitly excluded from a matching assertion and retained below. No full-chart equality or universal-school accuracy is claimed. The 辛-year 魁鉞 pair also differs and is retained as a named variant below.",
    "火星、鈴星 and the 38 adjective stars are outside this independent fixture. Existing structural audits do not make their placements independently verified."
  ],
  "known_differences": [
    {
      "field": "birth_year_transformations[壬][科]",
      "reference": "天府",
      "default_engine": "左輔",
      "reason": "The cited classical table says 壬梁紫府武; default iztro uses a different 壬 table. The 壬 fixture checks only 祿、權、忌 against the classic."
    },
    {
      "field": "minor_star_branches[辛]",
      "reference": {
        "天魁": "寅",
        "天鉞": "午"
      },
      "default_engine": {
        "天魁": "午",
        "天鉞": "寅"
      },
      "reason": "The cited transcript says 六辛逢虎馬 under 安天魁天鉞訣; the default engine uses the reversed pair. The 辛 fixture preserves the reference values, and a separate variant test records the difference."
    },
    {
      "field": "minor_star_branches[丙丁][天鉞]",
      "reference": "戌",
      "default_engine": "酉",
      "independent_fortel": "酉",
      "reason": "The pinned Wikisource transcript says 丙丁豬狗位, not 豬雞位. Without a scanned-edition collation this cannot support the adopted 酉 value or be silently corrected as a typo. The two adopted values are instead independently supported by the separately pinned Fortel source table."
    }
  ],
